{"meta":{"id":"env-templates","category":"aide/modules","title":"환경 설정 템플릿","subtitle":"(ignore·Docker)","summary":"gitignore/dockerignore + Docker 기본 구성(FastAPI+MySQL+Redis)","tags":["aide","모듈","docker","gitignore"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-files","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-200/60 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>\n      3-modules\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Reusable Modules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    환경 설정 템플릿 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-teal-600 font-serif\">(ignore·Docker)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/60 border border-teal-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 그대로 복사해 쓰는 .gitignore/.dockerignore, 기본 Docker 구성(Python/FastAPI+MySQL+Redis)\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">1-ignore</code> — 매번 새로 쓰지 않고 그대로 복사해 시작하는 .gitignore/.dockerignore (myWiki도 이걸 그대로 복사해서 시작함)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">2-docker</code> — app(FastAPI) + mysql + redis 3개 서비스, 전부 env 변수로 설정값을 받는 로컬 개발용 compose</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">스택이 다르면 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">복사한 뒤 베이스 이미지/설치·실행 명령만 교체</strong>한다 — 구조는 그대로 재사용</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">파일 구성</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">5개 파일</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[34%]\">구분 및 파일</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[66%]\">내용</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-teal-700 bg-teal-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[ignore]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">.gitignore</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">.env*, node_modules/, __pycache__/, venv/, 빌드 산출물, 로그, zip/bak/tmp 등 공통 항목</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-teal-700 bg-teal-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[ignore]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">.dockerignore</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">.git/, 문서/테스트 폴더 등 빌드 컨텍스트에서 뺄 것들</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[docker]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">Dockerfile</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">python:3.12-slim 기반, requirements 설치 후 uvicorn 실행, 8000 포트 노출</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[docker]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">docker-compose.yml</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">app + mysql:8.0.34 + redis, db-init/이 MySQL 최초 기동 시 자동 실행</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[db]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">db-init/*.sql</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">스키마/계정 생성 스크립트, 파일명 순서대로 자동 실행</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">알아두면 좋은 점</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">docker-compose의 모든 값은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.env.example</code>에 예시로 정의되어 있고, 실제 값은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">.env</code>에서 채운다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">서비스가 더 늘어나면(중규모 이상) 그만큼 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">docker-compose.yml</code>에 서비스를 추가한다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Reusable Modules</span>\n  <span>환경 설정 템플릿</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/modules/env-templates","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"modules","title":"3-modules (재사용 모듈)","path":"aide/modules"}],"hasImage":false}